
---

# ✅ `.gitignore` (Use This Exactly)

```gitignore
# Node
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Environment variables
.env
.env.local
.env.development
.env.production

# Build outputs
dist/
build/

# Vite
.vite/

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editor / IDE
.vscode/
.idea/

# Logs
logs/
*.log

# Coverage
coverage/

# Temporary files
*.tmp
